# Production keeps large local scrape caches and snapshot archives under the
# repo root. Keep them out of Docker contexts while allowing the committed
# engine snapshots required by API/web images. These explicit patterns are
# intentionally compatible with the older docker-compose/Docker engine on prod.
backups
backups/*
backups/*/*
backups/*/*/*
data/raw
data/raw/*
data/raw/*/*
data/raw/*/*/*
data/processed
data/processed/*
data/processed/*/*
data/cache
data/cache/*
data/cache/*/*
data/*
!data/laurie-engine
!data/laurie-engine/*
*.parquet
*.duckdb
